{"overview":"روزی، اوساگی تسوکی‌نو، دانش‌آموز دبیرستانی دو ساله و ناتوان، با یک گربه سخنگو به نام لونا برخورد می‌کند. لونا به او می‌گوید که او مقدر است که سایلور مون، «قهرمان عشق و عدالت»، شود و باید به دنبال شاهزاده‌ی افسانه‌ای ماه بگردد. اوساگی دوستانی پیدا می‌کند که نیز به‌عنوان سِنشی مقدر هستند و با هم برای نجات جهان از نابودی قطعی که توسط پادشاهی تاریک به وجود آمده، مبارزه می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"One day, Usagi Tsukino, clumsy 2nd-year middle school student, stumbles upon a talking cat named Luna. Luna tells her that she is destined to be Sailor Moon, \"champion of love and justice\", and she must search for the fabled Moon Princess. Usagi finds friends that turn out to be destined senshi as well, and together they fight to save the world from the certain doom brought upon by the Dark Kingdom.","tagline_en":"In the name of the Moon, I'll punish you!","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":1995,"poster":"/uE9mtzmQ7z5pGY9sbHLVlsh8bUX.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":46,"y":1992,"poster":"/pCeCsZmLaZKR2SdgctVlzGMJi6i.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":43,"y":1993,"poster":"/jKw3f6qUnPUhNcmHliKNv3G7kLg.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":38,"y":1994,"poster":"/isevGUj0qHBDnXs0s0uGa6NNcv7.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":39,"y":1995,"poster":"/dLPCz8ha3TF5xdwrzyQOzhKXEVy.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":34,"y":1996,"poster":"/fjkJcNqL7VEskD0H8qRFOzSn2OL.jpg"}],"episodes":200,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"三石琴乃","role":"Usagi Tsukino / Sailor Moon (voice)","photo":"/dRqbE5D3uqfKnAPsHp9etsvO1Gg.jpg","en":"Kotono Mitsuishi"},{"name":"久川綾","role":"Ami Mizuno / Sailor Mercury (voice)","photo":"/5asVy8H7VSDQKVdURubT0QHjsld.jpg","en":"Aya Hisakawa"},{"name":"富沢美智恵","role":"Rei Hino / Sailor Mars (voice)","photo":"/42Au1FT7mGOghHcrlX8g44v6dTG.jpg","en":"Michie Tomizawa"},{"name":"امی شینوهارا","role":"Makoto Kino / Sailor Jupiter (voice)","photo":"/ryGauSE9aoEh5DFMrlFw3H8sATC.jpg","en":"Emi Shinohara"